+4. Loop `x` from 0 to `m_dimX - 1`, `z` from 0 to `m_dimY - 1`, and `y` from 0 to `m_dimZ - 1` [S1, unofficial]. Note: The source specifies the loop order as x, z, y [S1, unofficial].
